    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2c4744ae32bbb81",
      "translationZh": "作者：Noor Abo Mokh , Kirill Chirkunov , Teresa Lynn , Nizar Habash , Reham Marzouk , Malik H. Altakrori , Younes Samih , Muhammed Abu Odeh , Nour Rabih , Rahaf Alshahrani , Hamad Alshehhi , Hamdan Al-Ali , Muhra Almahri , Besher Hassan , Mohamed Anwar , Abed Alhakim Freihat , Preslav Nakov , Alham Fikri Aji",
